{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24966","headline":"送沈侯之京 · 牟融","name":"送沈侯之京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠旌斾出东楼，特出仙郎上帝州。\n刘旻才高能富国，萧何人杰足封侯。\n关河弱柳垂金缕，水驿青帘拂画楼。\n欲尽故人尊酒意，春风江上暂停舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}